WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.842
(alarm sounds)

00:00:03.842 --> 00:00:08.207
- That was super, super ridiculously sour.

00:00:12.551 --> 00:00:14.651
- I thought it would
be a really funny idea

00:00:14.651 --> 00:00:15.754
to go around the office

00:00:15.754 --> 00:00:18.494
and test people's sour candy threshold,

00:00:18.494 --> 00:00:20.827
so I went looking for the
sourest candy in the world.

00:00:20.827 --> 00:00:22.205
I couldn't get my hands on it,

00:00:22.205 --> 00:00:25.491
but I found the next best
thing, these bad boys.

00:00:26.623 --> 00:00:27.923
They're actually from the U.K.

00:00:27.923 --> 00:00:29.621
They're not even available in the U.S.

00:00:29.621 --> 00:00:32.593
So, I'm gonna go around and see
what people think; let's go.

00:00:32.593 --> 00:00:34.424
What's your relationship with sour candy?

00:00:34.424 --> 00:00:35.121
Do you like it?

00:00:35.121 --> 00:00:37.884
- I usually like sour candy,
not like crazy sour stuff.

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:40.183
- You know, I'm very sensitive to it.

00:00:40.183 --> 00:00:42.922
- I don't know why people put
themselves through the pain.

00:00:42.922 --> 00:00:46.391
- Sour candy, first of all,
should not be called sour candy.

00:00:46.391 --> 00:00:49.157
It should just be called
sour pieces of (beep).

00:00:49.157 --> 00:00:50.120
- I can't stand sour candy.

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:50.701
- You don't like sour candy?

00:00:50.701 --> 00:00:51.385
- Not at all.

00:00:51.385 --> 00:00:52.396
I find it extremely painful,

00:00:52.396 --> 00:00:54.116
and it hurts my whole mouth.

00:00:54.116 --> 00:00:57.332
- I used to love sour candy,
but now I'm afraid of it.

00:00:57.332 --> 00:00:58.664
- [Voiceover] I'm scared now.

00:00:58.664 --> 00:01:01.323
- It looks like a tiny,
pink munchkin doughnut.

00:01:01.323 --> 00:01:02.344
- A large marble.

00:01:02.344 --> 00:01:03.599
- It looks like a bouncy ball

00:01:03.599 --> 00:01:06.790
that's been coated in illegal (beep).

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:09.396
- It's pretending to be
sweet, but it's like poison.

00:01:09.396 --> 00:01:11.286
- This is safe, though, right?

00:01:11.286 --> 00:01:14.193
- One, two, three.

00:01:19.399 --> 00:01:21.423
(laughs)

00:01:26.546 --> 00:01:31.229
(dramatic music)

00:02:09.419 --> 00:02:12.342
- I thought we were friends!

00:02:12.342 --> 00:02:14.598
- They're like a warhead on steroids.

00:02:14.598 --> 00:02:16.598
- If you swallow it, it burns your throat.

00:02:16.598 --> 00:02:19.158
- It's like when they put
the vacuum in your mouth

00:02:19.158 --> 00:02:20.782
at the dentist's to suck
all the moisture out.

00:02:20.782 --> 00:02:21.862
That's what's going on with this.

00:02:21.862 --> 00:02:22.721
- It's like battery acid.

00:02:22.721 --> 00:02:25.270
- It tastes like what I
imagine cleaning fluid

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:26.009
to taste like.

00:02:26.009 --> 00:02:27.261
- Detergent!

00:02:27.261 --> 00:02:28.723
- It tastes like a punishment!

00:02:28.723 --> 00:02:31.777
- It tastes like someone shot
a machine gun in my face!

00:02:32.807 --> 00:02:34.614
- Is there a hole in my tongue?

00:02:34.614 --> 00:02:36.595
- I got through it and then I bit into it,

00:02:36.595 --> 00:02:38.432
and then it started foaming,

00:02:38.432 --> 00:02:40.255
and I felt like I had rabies.

00:02:40.255 --> 00:02:42.598
- I spit it out in my cup of water,

00:02:42.598 --> 00:02:45.756
and it's like fizzing in here.

00:02:45.756 --> 00:02:48.303
That's what it's doing in
your stomach right now.

00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:50.583
- Yeah, it's pretty sour.

00:02:50.583 --> 00:02:52.115
Its NBD, though.

00:02:52.115 --> 00:02:52.801
- NBD.

00:02:52.801 --> 00:02:54.461
Okay, I was told by my colleagues

00:02:54.461 --> 00:02:57.538
that it's only fair
that I try this as well.

00:02:59.828 --> 00:03:04.828
Mmm, uhh, mmm, mmm.

00:03:06.945 --> 00:03:07.677
Mmm.

00:03:07.677 --> 00:03:12.351
(perky music)

